%%body
{
  As you poked away at the steel process and watched as your first steel lump was ready, Nori sent his usual messages.

    @ Nori "I did some searching."

  Searching?

    @ Nori "Yes, Knight was unusual, while I don't think you picked up anything like you did with Kavinu, I found its existence to be unusual."

  Unusual, you mean more than Harmonia being unusual?

    @ Nori "Knight was similar to you in a way, a spirit bound to some kind of shell, if the shell wanted to entrap you rather than help you that is."

  Knight was trapped?

    @ Nori "It is difficult to describe, its spirit was bound to the shell, but it seemed convinced it was doing something important."

  So, it was gaslit.

    @ Nori "Now that is a word I haven't heard in awhile, indeed, it could have been tricked into its duty, nonetheless, it may not be the first nor the last of its kind."

  Just glorious...

}
%date 2026-08-13, 2026-08-15
